    <statement><p>If 
<me>f(x) =  \frac {\sqrt { x } - 4 }{\sqrt { x } + 4 }</me> 
find <m>f'( x )</m>.</p>
<p><m>f'( x )</m> = <fillin characters="48" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p>Find <m>f'( 5 )</m>.</p>
<p><m>f'( 5 )</m> = <fillin characters="48" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{\frac{4}{\sqrt{x}}}{\left(\sqrt{x}+4\right)^{2}}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{\frac{4}{\sqrt{5}}}{\left(\sqrt{5}+4\right)^{2}}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
